# Web UI

- Follow skill `crystal-frontend-ui` (reads `frontend-design` + `web-design-guidelines`).
- Mobile-first. Do not ship until 375px layout holds.
- This repo is static HTML/CSS/JS for GitHub Pages. Do not add Next.js or a fat bundler unless Pages deploy stays one-command.
- Asset paths must be relative (`./assets/…`) so the site works at `/card/`.
- Do not commit `node_modules/`.
- Before done: open the page (browser MCP if available) and click the primary CTA.
